        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "Product",
        "category": "RealEstate",
        "description": "Every home looks better in cedar!! Put your eye's on the Cedar Hill presented by WM Construction. This stunning home could be yours in the sought after North Village Subdivision. Currently to be built status, once ground is broken this home can be complete in just 6 months. There is still time to personalize. Price reflects an extended 35' deep 3rd car bay and 100K in upgrades!! Enjoy breathtaking mountain views and southern exposure. This spacious layout features a desirable split-bedroom design, providing privacy for the owner's suite while keeping secondary bedrooms conveniently located.\n\nStep into the open-concept main living area where vaulted ceilings and expansive windows create a bright and inviting atmosphere. The kitchen is the heart of the home, complete with a large island, ample cabinetry, and a walk-in pantry--ideal for both everyday living and entertaining.\n\nThe luxurious owner's suite offers a peaceful retreat with a spa-inspired bathroom and generous walk-in closet. Additional highlights include a dedicated laundry room, plenty of storage throughout, and well-appointed secondary bedrooms.\n\nUpstairs, a versatile and stately bonus room provides endless possibilities--perfect for a home office, media room, playroom, or guest space.\n\nWith quality craftsmanship, thoughtful details, and a highly functional layout, the Cedar Hill is designed to fit a variety of lifestyles.\n\nLooking for something different? WM Construction offers a wide selection of floor plans and is actively building in several desirable subdivisions across the Mat-Su Valley. Reach out today to explore your options and secure your new home!\n\nPhotos are 'photo similar' and represent a previously completed home of the similar floor plan. Images may depict upgrades, optional features, and design selections not included in the listed price. Buyers are advised to verify standard specifications and upgrade options with the builder.",
